{"service_provider_name": "SendCanary", "service_provider_id": "sendcanary.com", "service_id": "email-setup", "name": "Email Security Setup (DMARC + SPF + BIMI)", "version": 4, "versions": [4], "description": "SendCanary complete email security bundle: publishes CNAMEs for DMARC and BIMI (pointing at SendCanary-managed per-tenant record targets) plus an SPF TXT record. The CNAME indirection lets SendCanary evolve the underlying policy, selectors, and BIMI logo on your behalf - no more editing DNS every time you want to move DMARC to reject or rotate BIMI. Use this for a managed 'set and forget' setup; use the individual DMARC / SPF / BIMI templates if you prefer owning the raw record values yourself. SendCanary (https://sendcanary.com) is an email authentication platform that monitors DMARC reports, detects spoofing, and automates DNS remediation for domain owners.", "variable_description": "dmarcTarget: CNAME target SendCanary assigns for DMARC (e.g. <token>._dmarc.sendcanary.com). spfRecord: complete SPF TXT record value (e.g. 'v=spf1 include:spf.google.com include:amazonses.com ~all'). bimiTarget: CNAME target for BIMI (e.g. <token>._bimi.sendcanary.com).", "logo_url": "https://sendcanary.com/logo.svg", "template_sha": "27a9ac2a00ff05401c63710dbd732455b710e7dd", "created_at": "2026-03-26 09:16:21", "updated_at": "2026-04-25 07:02:45"}
